Remember to replace `"eth0"` with the actual name of the network interface you wish to monitor. Also, ensure proper error handling throughout your implementation. For more detailed guidance on creating Windows services, refer to Microsoft's documentation on developing Windows services (https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/services/service-development).

